    "text": "================================================================================\n                    CLOUD SERVICES AGREEMENT\n================================================================================\nThis Cloud Services Agreement is entered into by and between CloudMatrix Inc. (Provider)\nand Global Logistics Corp. (Customer) effective as of March 1, 2026.\n\nSECTION 1: TERM AND DURATION\nThe Initial Term shall be 24 months from the Effective Date.\n\nSECTION 2: RENEWAL\nThis Agreement automatically renews for successive 12-month periods unless either\nparty gives written notice of non-renewal at least 60 calendar days prior to expiration.\n\nSECTION 3: FEES AND PAYMENT SCHEDULE\nCustomer shall pay a recurring monthly fee of $25,000 USD. Invoices shall be paid\nwithin net 30 days of invoice date.\n\nSECTION 4: OBLIGATIONS\nProvider shall maintain system availability and daily encrypted backups of Customer data.\nCustomer shall maintain administrative account credentials with multi-factor authentication.\n\nSECTION 5: PENALTIES AND SERVICE CREDITS\nIf monthly availability falls below 99.5%, Customer is entitled to a 15% service credit\nagainst the monthly fee.\n\nSECTION 6: COMPLIANCE AND SECURITY\nEach party warrants compliance with applicable laws, including GDPR data protection\nregulations and SOC 2 Type II security measures.\n\nSECTION 7: TERMINATION\nEither party may terminate this Agreement for cause upon 30 days written notice if\nthe other party commits a material breach and fails to cure within 30 days.\n",
    "text_source": "txt",
